Package: RFRW
Type: Package
Title: Random Forests by Random Weights
Version: 1.0
Date: 2025-11-10
Author: Shihao Zhang [aut, cre],
  Zudi Lu [aut],
  Chao Zheng [aut]
Maintainer: Shihao Zhang <Shihao.Zhang@soton.ac.uk>
Description: Random Forests by Random Weights for nonlinear time series modelling. It avoids the bootstrap resampling procedure in the original random forests that break the serial dependence structure, whilst incorporates independent random weights to reduce correlations among trees.
License: GPL (>= 2)
Imports: Rcpp (>= 1.0.12)
LinkingTo: Rcpp
